00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:20.130
Ootori Tamaki...

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:23.130
They call her the young queen of the film industry! {So, two episodes with queens in a row? Wouldn't it be more relevant if they were princesses?}{toei is trolling you}

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.540
Yeah, the queen!

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:27.320
That's why Makoto has her hopes up!

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.880
She thought it might be the princess!

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.480
