 Snow White 
 Kenzaki Makoto

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.480
But when we met her for real...

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.360
I'm Kenzaki Makoto.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.680
I look forward to working with you.

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.390
Just don't be dead weight.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:43.350
She was more like a wicked queen!

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:44.860
Really...

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.840
I'm sure she was just in character.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:47.490
Huh?

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:49.260
Makopi's asleep.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:51.190
She looks tired.

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:54.030
She's so busy with filming during the day,

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:57.160
but she still spends every night searching for the princess.

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:00.640
Makopi...

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:05.420
You were pushing yourself so much, and we didn't even know...

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:12.180
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:14.650
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:17.520
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:19.560
Every day it sparkles

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:30.150
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:35.810
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:41.450
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:46.890
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:52.590
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:52.790 --> 00:02:01.470
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:03.140
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:05.540
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:08.370
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.180
What's more than just cute

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:15.050
is our promise between girls

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:21.090
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:26.990
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:39.000
Super Busy! 

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:39.000
Super Busy! 

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.470
My oh my,

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.470
Solitaire

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:42.970
you seem quite busy.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.950
But I've gotta keep going!

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:45.940
Thanks to you all,

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.910
we've found two Royal Crystals,

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:51.760
so the princess must be close.

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:57.090
Hey Makopi, can we go with you to work today?

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:00.790
We can't let you work so hard alone!

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:05.190
If we're with you, we might find a way to help out.

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:07.770
I second this proposal!

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:09.880
You girls...

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:12.330
Yotsuba Studios

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:12.370
Morning!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.870
Good morning!

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:15.320
Why the "Good mornings?"

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:17.680
No matter what time it is at a studio,

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:21.510
the greeting for when you start your work day is "Good morning."

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:25.760
Because people start working at all hours of the day!

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:27.990
You know a lot, Alice!

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:30.420
Her dad owns the place,

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:32.420
so Alice knows this stuff!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.480
So your dad owns a studio...

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:41.470
It's Takakura Yuujirou!

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:42.850
Oh, it is.

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:44.350
Good morning!

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:45.300
Hey, Mana?

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.290
Oh, morning.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.030
So cool!

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:52.540
I wish Mom could be here too!

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:53.660
It's over.

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:57.020
Mana's getting caught up in everything but helping Makopi.

00:03:57.430 --> 00:04:00.110
But I'm kind of relieved.

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:01.920
I might catch some of Mana's energy.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:04.650
If you catch anyone's, it'll be Mana's!

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:05.850
You say something?

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:07.920
All right!

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:10.870
Whether it's work or searching for the princess, I can do it!

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.800
All right, we're starting the rehearsal!

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:19.270
Break a leg.

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:21.470
You too.

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.260
My heart's pounding!

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:24.010
Yeah!

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.610
Mirror, mirror on the wall,

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:29.580
who is the fairest of them all?

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.050
It would be my queen, of course.

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:34.720
But nay, it is Snow White!

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:37.120
What? Snow White?

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:39.860
We're doing the next scene!

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:43.830
The queen disguises herself as an old woman to give Snow White the apple.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:47.450
Now, Ootori, come over here...

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:49.260
<i>Princess, where might you be?</i>

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.260
And Makoto will be...

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.150
Makoto?

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:52.300
Right!

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:53.750
You good to go?

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:54.990
I'm sorry!

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:57.520
Makoto...

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:58.780
All right, back to rehearsing!

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.480
Excuse me, young lady...

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:08.450
might you like a juicy apple?

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.810
<i>Oh no, my line!</i>

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:13.870
Cut!

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.860
Makoto, you gotta relax!

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:18.090
I'm sorry.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.240
I've been having my doubts,

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:24.270
but are you even paying attention?

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:26.790
Are you letting your mind wander?

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:29.110
Well...

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:31.510
Honestly, you disappoint me.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:36.820
She's scary!

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:40.400
Getting scolded that harshly will put her on edge!

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:43.990
Even so, it's unfitting for an actress.

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:46.790
The moment she steps on stage,

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:51.250
she ceases to be Makoto, and is instead Snow White!

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.170
I see...

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:55.470
It's a strict line of work.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.960
We're restarting the rehearsal!

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:01.380
<i>Keep it together!</i>

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.210
<i>You need to focus on acting!</i>

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:05.910
You can do it!

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:10.880
Oh Prince, wherever might you be?

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:14.350
I wish to see you right this moment!

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.260
You sure don't look like you do.

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:21.510
Wait, what happened?

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:24.990
Ootori Tamaki won't continue the performance.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:30.440
You didn't practice much, did you?

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:32.550
Your script is still crisp.

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:42.470
A lot of viewers are looking forward to this movie's completion. {Of fucking Snow White? I think they can wait.}

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:45.020
If you don't care, then go home.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:47.920
Ouch...

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:49.860
Kenzaki Makoto

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:51.900
What the heck, Ootori Tamaki?!

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:54.860
She's more wicked than the wicked queen!

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.420
Yeah, what Davi said!

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:02.660
Hey Makopi, do you want to go eat dinner at my place?

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:04.840
Grandpa and the others would love to see you!

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:07.300
Thank you,

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:09.710
but shooting starts early tomorrow.

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:10.910
I see...

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:12.580
Well, maybe next time!

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:15.770
Call me if you don't get around to doing your homework.

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:18.320
I would be pleased to help you as well.

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:21.850
Yotsuba Studios

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.720
Will Makopi be all right?

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:29.130
I hope she gets a good night's sleep,

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.790
but she'll probably be practicing her lines.

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:35.270
Makoto is quite the hard worker.

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.600
Makopi looks pretty worn out today.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.910
Looks like she's been filming since morning.

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:50.480
Actually, she went out searching for the princess last night after practice.

00:07:57.430 --> 00:08:00.060
She just can't stay still.

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:01.430
Neither can I!

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:03.860
With Makoto working so hard on her own,

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:05.660
I just can't sit back and watch!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:09.600
Hey, Makoto?

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:13.770
If it's too much, you can always quit.

00:08:13.770 --> 00:08:15.920
No, I'm fine.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:17.580
Just like Tamaki said,

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:21.590
there are people looking forward to this movie.

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:24.990
I can't just throw this away.

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:26.620
But still...

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:30.090
you've already done plenty.

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.070
No.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:33.220
I haven't done enough.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:37.160
My script is still so crisp,

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:41.710
but Tamaki's is worn down from being read so many times.

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:45.500
I have to push myself more and more!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.810
You've changed, Makoto.

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:50.680
You're not just about the princess.

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:54.890
You care about the people who support you, too.

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:58.520
In that case, how about leaving the search for the princess to us?

00:08:58.520 --> 00:09:01.510
We want to help you, Makopi!

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:03.320
We're your allies!

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:04.560
You girls...

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.530
Can I really ask you to do that?

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:08.620
Of course.

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:11.620
I'm touched that you'd ask us!

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:14.500
You don't have to push yourself alone.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:17.050
Thank you.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.700
Then, take these with you.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:26.860
The Crystals glowed the last time they were brought together, so that may happen again.

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:30.560
Also, if you get close to the princess,

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:33.350
these Crystals might let you know.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.030
Okay, I've got it!

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:41.390
So Makopi, relax and focus on your work!

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:44.130
Yeah!

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:51.820
<i>All right.</i>

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.040
<i>Now, I'm going to focus on my acting!</i>

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:57.490
<i>I won't let Tamaki outdo me!</i>

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.910
<i>For the staff that support us from behind the scenes,</i>

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:06.740
<i>and for my friends that are working hard for my sake...</i>

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.720
We'll start the actual filming now!

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.230
Now, action!

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:19.410
Oh Prince, wherever might you be?

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:22.930
I wish to see you right this moment.

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:29.010
Makoto's doin' good today.

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:30.980
She's really into it.

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:32.180
Not good enough.

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:35.530
More...

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.850
I know you're capable of more.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:41.610
I'm sorry!

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:43.250
I'd like to try that one more time!

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:48.750
Oh Prince, wherever might you be?

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.920
I wish to see you right this moment!

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:54.750
Prince!

00:10:57.350 --> 00:10:58.840
What's <i>this</i> supposed to be?

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:01.400
It's the corn you requested...

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:03.040
What's it <i>look</i> like?

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:06.340
That's why I'm asking why you got me a corn cob!

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:07.530
Huh?

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:10.680
You were the one saying you wanted to eat corn!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:14.710
The corn I want to eat isn't on a cob,

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:17.890
it's rich, luxuriously buttered corn!

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:19.040
You <i>kiddin'</i> me?!

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:23.440
If you want your corn buttered, you should specify...

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:25.500
What's the difference, anyway?

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:27.200
You meanies!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:29.630
I'm done with you.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:32.370
Oh, wherever might you be,

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:36.190
my good ol', rich, luxuriously buttered corn-esque girl?

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:38.110
That's a <i>thing</i>?!

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:43.760
We couldn't find the princess today.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:46.720
The Royal Crystals didn't respond, either.

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:49.830
Makoto's doing all she can,

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:51.770
so we should find something in her stead!

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:53.680
Yeah!

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:55.560
Phone call from Davi!

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.800
Girls, here's a message from Makoto!

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:02.770
We finished most of the shoot today, so tomorrow will be the last one.

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:04.780
Feel free to come watch!

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:06.520
Tomorrow's her last day.

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:08.390
We've gotta go see her!

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.280
Yeah!

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:25.920
Yotsuba Studios

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:28.930
Hm?

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:30.720
Oh, the guy from Solitaire!

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.600
Oh, what perfect timing!

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:37.500
I came to deliver some props to Makoto's movie set,

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:40.230
but I don't know which studio to go to.

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:44.770
Mirror, mirror on the wall,

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:47.780
who is the fairest of them all?

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:50.350
It would be my queen, of course.

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:52.950
But nay, it is Snow White!

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:54.900
Snow White?!

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:55.870
Indeed...

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:57.690
How could this be?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.530
The fairest one in all the lands...

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:03.470
should be none other than I!

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:05.800
Loathsome!

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:09.150
Oh, how I loathe thee, Snow White!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:12.400
<i>Amazing...</i>

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.510
<i>Tamaki really is amazing!</i>

00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:16.710
Found ya!

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:19.120
My good ol' buttered corn!

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:20.250
Or should I say,

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:21.810
a selfish girl!

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:23.080
It's you!

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.460
Why are you here?

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:28.750
Well ya see,

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:31.270
I smelled someone selfish,

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:32.760
so I made my way here.

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:34.590
Right?

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:37.030
You're selfish, aren't you?

00:13:37.030 --> 00:13:39.120
Who are you, child?

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:41.000
Tamaki, get back!

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:43.490
The heck?

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:44.510
Who's she?

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:47.660
It'd be my pleasure!

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:51.940
For me to become your master, that is!

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:53.340
Shut your mouth.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:55.790
Now stop interfering with our performance.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:58.080
Leave this place at once!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:13:59.380
Pooey!

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:01.640
Don't order me around!

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:04.620
<i>My</i> orders are absolute, though.

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:16.030
I'll turn you into a splendid Selfish!

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:33.950
Mirror Selfish!

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:35.550
What's that?!

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:37.070
Why?

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:39.760
Tamaki isn't selfish in the least!

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:43.460
Really? But what human <i>isn't</i> selfish?

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:48.430
Well, with my magic, I can turn <i>anyone</i> into a Selfish.

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:50.080
Selfish!

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:53.040
Shiiiiiiine!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.540
I felt a dark heartbeat!

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:59.440
It came from the studio!

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:01.210
Makopi!

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:09.250
Everyone and everything...

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:11.620
burn from my reflecting!

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:24.240
She's burning everything!

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:25.440
Makopi!

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:26.640
Girls!

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:27.800
Are you okay?

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.740
Take Tamaki somewhere safe!

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:31.700
Allow me.

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:35.150
Now everyone, this way.

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:39.280
Let's go, girls!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:40.520
Right!

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:43.250
Charles!

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:47.190
Precure Love Link!

00:15:48.100 --> 00:15:48.920
L-O-V-E!

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:49.620
L-O-V-E!

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:50.380
L-O-V-E!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:51.490
L-O-V-E!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:19.290
Brimming with love,

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:21.510
Cure Heart!

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:25.780
The light of wisdom,

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:28.050
Cure Diamond!

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:32.290
The warmth of the sun,

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.580
Cure Rosetta!

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.310
The blade of courage,

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:39.320
Cure Sword!

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:44.730
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.980
Dokidoki Precure!

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:51.160
Oh poor mirror who has lost her love,

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:53.390
I, Cure Heart,

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:56.590
will make your heart race once more!

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:00.970
If you wanna try, be my guests.

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:03.300
Reflection Ray!

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.040
Reflect!

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:10.110
Love Heart Arrow!

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:19.720
Precure Sparkle Swo—

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.220
Cut!

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:23.960
Get her, Selfish!

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:25.020
Now, shine!

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:29.390
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:37.400
Rosetta!

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:39.800
Don't worry. Let's fight together!

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:44.450
Precure Diamond Shower!

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:51.780
Now, Cure Heart!

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:52.550
Right!

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.470
Precure Heart Shoot!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:14.660
Nullifying Mirror!

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.690
How's my Selfish?

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:25.850
Great, isn't it?

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:27.400
No...

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:29.480
The Heart Shoot had no effect!

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:32.230
Does that mean we can't purify the Selfish?

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:34.620
What should we do?

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:38.630
Let's try with the four of us!

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:43.510
If we can't do it alone,

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:47.350
we can just combine our strengths, I'm certain!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:51.270
You girls taught me that.

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:53.040
Sword...

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:53.860
Now!

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:02.240
We can do anything together!

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:03.090
Yeah!

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:07.490
Ai!

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:09.990
Kyupirappa!

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:17.970
This is...

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:21.110
A new Lovies!

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:25.840
Everyone, let's go!

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:35.940
Precure Lovely Force Arrow!

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:58.250
Love love loooooove!

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:16.430
Thank goodness.

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:17.450
Yeah!

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:18.700
We did it!

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:26.470
Wow, you guys beat up my Selfish!

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:28.910
Haven't we seen you before?

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:30.540
Who might you be?

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:33.700
I am Regina.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:37.010
King Selfish's daughter.

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:38.250
Huh?!

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:41.820
King Selfish's... daughter?

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:43.870
Welp, see ya!

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:48.790
Snow White

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:48.790
Sneak Preview

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:48.790
m 193 85 l 190 261 l 1152 0 l 424 -1

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:48.790
Snow White

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:48.790
Snow White

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:48.790
Kenzaki Makoto

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:48.790
Kenzaki Makoto

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:48.790
Ootori Tamaki

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:48.790
Ootori Tamaki

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:54.570
Everyone, we humbly thank you for attending.

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:59.040
Thanks to you all, we were able to complete a wonderful film.

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:04.090
I'd like to thank the fans and staff for supporting us, and...

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:09.340
a certain hard working, irreplaceable partner.

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:10.380
Huh?

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:28.030
Tamaki's compliment made me so happy.

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:30.560
Let's exchange scripts.

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:32.240
To remember this for life.

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:49.620
A Royal Crystal!

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:54.370
It's as though they called for each other!

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:00.000
Princess...

00:22:07.070 --> 00:22:09.440
Mana, I'll let you be my friend!

00:22:09.440 --> 00:22:10.470
Huh? Regina?!

00:22:10.870 --> 00:22:13.540
She seems to have taken a liking to Mana.

00:22:13.540 --> 00:22:14.750
Let's play, Mana!

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:16.910
I can't! I'm in class!

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:18.920
Aw, just skip it.

00:22:18.920 --> 00:22:20.380
I can't just...

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:23.020
Regina's an enemy, so how could she be our friend?

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:25.460
I don't know what Mana's thinking...

00:22:26.620 --> 00:22:28.090
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.090 --> 00:22:31.300
Regina's Fierce Attack!

00:22:28.090 --> 00:22:31.300
Regina's Fierce Attack!

00:22:31.800 --> 00:22:33.800
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
